

1. Safety Rules
	•	Never delete, rename, or move any files or folders.
	•	Never modify package.json, app.json, tsconfig.json, babel.config.js, or Metro-related config files unless explicitly instructed.
	•	Never introduce new libraries or dependencies unless explicitly requested.
	•	Never refactor entire files automatically.
	•	Never remove existing imports, navigation code, i18n structure, Lottie configuration, or project setup unless instructed.

